Run sfall's SetGlobalVar, CarTravel, SetLighting, TargetObject, Sneak and AdjustPoison hooks

The hooks the known mods register that CE never ran: SetGlobalVar (six of
them), CarTravel, SetLighting (Fallout Et Tu), TargetObject, Sneak and
AdjustPoison (Olympus, Fallout Yesterday). Each runs where sfall runs it,
with its arguments and return values; their hook scripts load too.
